    { "id": 7863152384, "name": "LM virtual practice", "sport_type": "Run", "start_date_local": "2022-09-25T08:26:37", "distance_m": 14516.3, "moving_time_s": 4560, "elapsed_time_s": 4583, "elevation_gain_m": 18, "description": "Trying 2 mile loop route using car as an aid station every 6 miles at target pace. Can’t decide if I want to do this as run/walk intervals or not. Either way, it’s going to be fucking hard 😂\n\nUsed handheld with Maurten 160 mix (40g carbs) & a 33Fuel vanilla chia gel (11g carbs) over the 6 miles. Playlist: 🧀\n\nCold! Will need gloves on the day." },
    { "id": 7863328489, "name": "LM virtual 5K app test", "sport_type": "Run", "start_date_local": "2022-09-25T09:48:13", "distance_m": 5238.66, "moving_time_s": 1621, "elapsed_time_s": 1625, "elevation_gain_m": 6, "description": "Note to self for the day. Don’t rush when putting phone into waist belt after pressing “START” so the phone bounces out onto the pavement after a few seconds 🙄" },
