    { "id": 7899657106, "name": "London Marathon Virtual - 3:16:47 Official Time 🧐", "sport_type": "Run", "start_date_local": "2022-10-02T09:23:30", "distance_m": 42334.7, "moving_time_s": 13378, "elapsed_time_s": 14139, "elevation_gain_m": 119, "description": "Who’s right… mentally hard being told through the headphones by Steve Cram in the official app that you’ve finished when your watch says another 4 miles 😩 \n\nAfter that, I slowed down a lot and just wanted to lock in sub-4 in case the phone GPS was wrong. I was broken at that point anyway. Phone GPS is more accurate isn’t it? Lot of turns and tree cover on that route.\n\nWas losing around 0.15 miles as I compared splits after each mile announcement through the app.\n\nI may have run over 30 miles 😂😭😭😭\n\nDickhead dickhead dickhead, should have chosen a more open route with no tree cover 😖 Anyway, sub-4 so I never have to do another one of these things ever again, I’ve banished the Ghost of Manchester Marathon 🥳" },
    { "id": 7904213612, "name": "Recovery walk", "sport_type": "Walk", "start_date_local": "2022-10-03T11:24:04", "distance_m": 5533.97, "moving_time_s": 3077, "elapsed_time_s": 3077, "elevation_gain_m": 11.5, "description": "Back to the loop to test the distance with phone GPS. Yep, did an extra ~3 miles yesterday... 🤦‍♂️ My time was more like 3:26 not 3:16." },
