    { "id": 8077622090, "name": "Wild Trail Mcr Run", "sport_type": "TrailRun", "start_date_local": "2022-11-06T09:10:18", "distance_m": 28983.3, "moving_time_s": 15650, "elapsed_time_s": 18076, "elevation_gain_m": 934, "description": "Just the ticket after 7 hours in the pub watching the rugby autumn internationals 🍻 ☘️\n\n13 miles with WTM, 5 solo. Ages since I’ve run with WTM, great to be back! Sooooo close to spraining ankle on a rock around mile 11. Feeling it a bit now that I’m home.\n\n⛰️ Lost Lad (518 m) • ⛰️ Back Tor (538 m) • ⛰️ Win Hill (463 m) | 🌐 summitbag.com" },
